[I] The next generation HTTP client

[T] HTTPX is a fully featured HTTP client library for Python 3. It includes an
[T] integrated command line client, has support for both HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2,
[T] and provides both sync and async APIs.

[U] https://github.com/encode/httpx

